    "name": "TechMaster Phase 04 - Task 01: Authentication Foundation",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman test suite for Task 01 Authentication Foundation. Validates Registration, Login, Claims Extraction, Role Protection, Password Hashing, Refresh Token Rotation, and Error Rejection scenarios.",
